                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8c3fd162-4915-300c-ab1e-dfc71cae9b3c",
                        "entry_id": "f35b8153-afa7-3279-9b14-bc9b55233104",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a widespread or large manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a4732e0-4358-417a-8244-835ccf564f14",
                                "sense_id": "8c3fd162-4915-300c-ab1e-dfc71cae9b3c",
                                "text": "She smiled at Aristide, who smiled at her, and Jean, seeing them happy, smiled largely at them both."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bd2d37d8-8cf7-37e0-a15b-3fc601da1152",
                        "entry_id": "f35b8153-afa7-3279-9b14-bc9b55233104",
                        "glosses": [
                            "For the most part; mainly or chiefly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cff60d2-3ec8-48bb-bba7-9b3ff427a384",
                                "sense_id": "bd2d37d8-8cf7-37e0-a15b-3fc601da1152",
                                "text": "They were largely successful in their efforts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89e53e85-c0b6-4570-9b5c-6d2e0e046f0b",
                                "sense_id": "bd2d37d8-8cf7-37e0-a15b-3fc601da1152",
                                "text": "Herbarium material does not, indeed, allow one to extrapolate safely: what you see is what you get; what you get is classical alpha-taxonomy which is, very largely and for sound reasons, in disrepute today."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "460f5c27-2456-4d92-a2ac-24a5c03aac73",
                                "sense_id": "bd2d37d8-8cf7-37e0-a15b-3fc601da1152",
                                "text": "Yet in “Through a Latte, Darkly”, a new study of how Starbucks has largely avoided paying tax in Britain, Edward Kleinbard […] shows that current tax rules make it easy for all sorts of firms to generate what he calls “stateless income”: […]. In Starbucks’s case, the firm has in effect turned the process of making an expensive cup of coffee into intellectual property."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1864cbb5-7e5f-4caf-b186-c5dbe7527c4f",
                                "sense_id": "bd2d37d8-8cf7-37e0-a15b-3fc601da1152",
                                "text": "But with the war also still largely stalemated, other theatres of conflict have become more important. In Russia’s case, that includes the secret domain."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f93c2a93-bcbf-3403-b51d-5044fc060767",
                        "entry_id": "f35b8153-afa7-3279-9b14-bc9b55233104",
                        "glosses": [
                            "On a large scale; amply."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61e4a3aa-90f2-4500-878b-0ff1a1079c10",
                                "sense_id": "f93c2a93-bcbf-3403-b51d-5044fc060767",
                                "text": "Usually there was a jug of one or other decoction standing on the hob, from which he drank largely.\n\"Grand!\" he said, smacking his lips after wormwood. \"Grand!\" And he exhorted the children to try."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "281cb87c-0867-3f6e-9a5c-3b75dc0a75f7",
                        "entry_id": "f35b8153-afa7-3279-9b14-bc9b55233104",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fully, at great length."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f7f9455-3f64-495b-b828-ca5fc45cef09",
                                "sense_id": "281cb87c-0867-3f6e-9a5c-3b75dc0a75f7",
                                "text": "It ill beseemes a knight of gentle sort, / Such as ye haue him boasted, to beguile / A simple mayd, and worke so haynous tort, / In shame of knighthood, as I largely can report."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e9c9471d-e982-41fd-a809-43a2038db7e2",
                        "source_entry_id": "f35b8153-afa7-3279-9b14-bc9b55233104",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a widespread or large manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "en grande partie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "en grande partie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "249f57e5-94db-3092-bd35-2c1ca444481c",
                                        "entry_id": "3d9ba41d-c3f0-3582-bc72-e1db7ae36998",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nuance de en partie (partiellement) : avec une part importante."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2df1c87-c24d-468c-a0f5-9cd1122cbe75",
                                                "sense_id": "249f57e5-94db-3092-bd35-2c1ca444481c",
                                                "text": "Malgré cela, les relations commerciales entre l’Asie du Sud-Est et l’Union européenne ne sont pas bonnes, et c’est en grande partie la responsabilité de l’UE. Au cœur de cette situation se trouve un différend concernant les règles de l’UE en matière de déforestation, qui portent gravement atteinte à l’exploration de l’huile de palme, un produit d’exportation important pour des économies telles que la Malaisie et l’Indonésie. Les exigences de plus en plus strictes de l’UE ont suscité la colère des puissances exportatrices de l’Asie du Sud-Est, les poussant même à geler les négociations commerciales avec l’UE."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "404757cf-72df-4d36-9c4e-a5e3a34f88d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "f35b8153-afa7-3279-9b14-bc9b55233104",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a widespread or large manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "largement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
